'''AYE AYE Fun Cups''' is a series of one-day tournaments with different formats and map pools. Created in 2020 by {{player|Stalkerrh|flag=no}}, these tourneys have taken many different forms, be it duel or 2on2, double bracket or round robin, weekly or whenever someone felt like it, however the focus has always been on fun, fast tournaments for all skill levels.

